      "question": "How does a kitchen or bathroom project work?",
      "answer": "It starts with a consultation to understand your space, needs and budget. We then measure on site and share a design with a detailed quotation. Once you approve it, we prepare everything and install it."
    },
    {
      "question": "Can I see the design before I confirm?",
      "answer": "Yes. We share the layout, materials and finishes with you for approval before any work begins, and you can ask for changes at that stage."
    },
