      "question": "How long does installation take?",
      "answer": "It depends on the size of the project and the materials you choose. Your quotation includes an estimated timeline so you can plan around it."
    },
    {
      "question": "Do you supply appliances and accessories too?",
      "answer": "Yes. We can plan chimneys, hobs, built-in ovens, microwaves, dishwashers and refrigerators into your kitchen, along with sinks, faucets, pantry units and other accessories."
    },
